# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The brickwork and the Floquet cycle {#the-brickwork-and-the-floquet-cycle}"
msgstr "Brickwork dan kitaran Floquet {#the-brickwork-and-the-floquet-cycle}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gates tile the square lattice in four *sublayers* of non-overlapping bonds, a brickwork: horizontal bonds starting on even columns, then odd columns, then vertical bonds starting on even rows, then odd rows. Qubit $y \\cdot L_x + x$ sits at site $(x, y)$.\n"
msgstr "Gate menjubin kekisi segi empat sama dalam empat *sublapisan* ikatan yang tidak bertindih, iaitu brickwork: ikatan mengufuk bermula pada lajur genap, kemudian lajur ganjil, kemudian ikatan menegak bermula pada baris genap, kemudian baris ganjil. Qubit $y \\cdot L_x + x$ terletak pada tapak $(x, y)$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The four sublayers make one *Floquet cycle*. The cycle repeats $n_F$ times with **the same fields**, so the dynamics are random in space and periodic in time. The circuit starts from the Néel state, and $n_F$ is half the side length of the lattice.\n"
"The next cell draws one Floquet cycle of the $8 \\times 8$ hardware lattice, sublayer by sublayer, with the fields of the hardware run, in the style of Figure 5 of the paper. Thick bonds are the gates of each sublayer. Each qubit a gate acts on is colored by the random field $h$ it then receives, and idle qubits are white. The arrows show the Néel initial state, with $\\uparrow$ for $|0\\rangle$. The paper's figure applies the vertical sublayers first; neither order is expected to change the physics.\n"
msgstr ""
"Keempat-empat sublapisan membentuk satu *kitaran Floquet*. Kitaran itu berulang $n_F$ kali dengan **medan yang sama**, jadi dinamik adalah rawak dalam ruang dan berkala dalam masa. Litar bermula daripada keadaan Néel, dan $n_F$ ialah separuh panjang sisi kekisi.\n"
"Sel seterusnya melukis satu kitaran Floquet bagi kekisi perkakasan $8 \\times 8$, sublapisan demi sublapisan, dengan medan run perkakasan, dalam gaya Rajah 5 kertas kerja itu. Ikatan tebal ialah gate bagi setiap sublapisan. Setiap qubit yang dikenakan gate diwarnakan mengikut medan rawak $h$ yang kemudian diterimanya, dan qubit melahu berwarna putih. Anak panah menunjukkan keadaan awal Néel, dengan $\\uparrow$ untuk $|0\\rangle$. Rajah dalam kertas kerja menggunakan sublapisan menegak dahulu; tiada satu pun tertib dijangka mengubah fizik.\n"

