# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate the $4 \\times 4$ lattice {#simulate-the-4-times-4-lattice}"
msgstr "Simulasikan kekisi $4 \\times 4$ {#simulate-the-4-times-4-lattice}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the $4 \\times 4$ lattice, you can do both: compute the exact state at every coupling, and sample every circuit with 10,000 shots, as an experiment would. The shots are stored with shape (batches, shots, qubits), the same layout as the randomizations in the hardware data. Here all 10,000 shots form a single batch, so the bootstrap over batches adds no shot noise, and the error bars in the next plot show only the spread between marginal positions.\n"
msgstr "Untuk kekisi $4 \\times 4$, anda boleh melakukan kedua-duanya: mengira keadaan tepat pada setiap gandingan, dan mensampel setiap litar dengan 10,000 shot, seperti eksperimen. Shot disimpan dengan bentuk (kelompok, shot, qubit), susun atur yang sama seperti rawak dalam data perkakasan. Di sini kesemua 10,000 shot membentuk satu kelompok, jadi bootstrap ke atas kelompok tidak menambah hingar shot, dan bar ralat dalam plot seterusnya hanya menunjukkan serakan antara kedudukan marginal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. What to measure and how to estimate it {#2-what-to-measure-and-how-to-estimate-it}"
msgstr "2. Apa yang diukur dan cara menganggarkannya {#2-what-to-measure-and-how-to-estimate-it}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IPR and the collision entropy {#the-ipr-and-the-collision-entropy}"
msgstr "IPR dan entropi perlanggaran {#the-ipr-and-the-collision-entropy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a marginal $A$ of $n_A$ qubits with bitstring distribution $p_A(a)$, the quantity to estimate is the inverse participation ratio (IPR) of the marginal distribution, and from it the collision entropy:\n"
msgstr "Untuk marginal $A$ dengan $n_A$ qubit dan taburan rentetan bit $p_A(a)$, kuantiti yang dianggarkan ialah nisbah penyertaan songsang (IPR) bagi taburan marginal, dan daripadanya entropi perlanggaran:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{IPR}_A = \\sum_a p_A(a)^2, \\qquad S_2[A] = -\\log_2 \\mathrm{IPR}_A\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{IPR}_A = \\sum_a p_A(a)^2, \\qquad S_2[A] = -\\log_2 \\mathrm{IPR}_A\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\mathrm{IPR}_A$ is also the probability that two shots agree on the marginal. A product state has $\\mathrm{IPR}_A = 1$, and a random state has $\\mathrm{IPR}_A \\approx 2^{-n_A}$, so $S_2$ climbs from 0 to about $n_A$ bits as the marginal becomes random.\n"
msgstr "$\\mathrm{IPR}_A$ juga ialah kebarangkalian bahawa dua shot sepakat pada marginal. Keadaan hasil darab mempunyai $\\mathrm{IPR}_A = 1$, dan keadaan rawak mempunyai $\\mathrm{IPR}_A \\approx 2^{-n_A}$, jadi $S_2$ naik daripada 0 kepada kira-kira $n_A$ bit apabila marginal menjadi rawak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Estimator 1: count pairs of shots {#estimator-1-count-pairs-of-shots}"
msgstr "Penganggar 1: kira pasangan shot {#estimator-1-count-pairs-of-shots}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Question.** How do you estimate this quantity from your shots?\n"
msgstr "> **Soalan.** Bagaimana anda menganggarkan kuantiti ini daripada shot anda?\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The naive estimator computes each $p(a)$ from the shots as $\\hat p(a) = n_a / N$, then sums $\\sum_a \\hat p(a)^2$.\n"
"This estimator is biased.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penganggar naif mengira setiap $p(a)$ daripada shot sebagai $\\hat p(a) = n_a / N$, kemudian menjumlahkan $\\sum_a \\hat p(a)^2$.\n"
"Penganggar ini berat sebelah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\sum_a n_a^2 / N^2$ counts every shot as agreeing with itself, which pushes the estimate up: on average it gives $\\mathrm{IPR}_A + (1 - \\mathrm{IPR}_A)/N$ instead of $\\mathrm{IPR}_A$. Since $\\mathrm{IPR}_A$ is the probability that two shots agree, count only pairs of *different* shots:\n"
msgstr "$\\sum_a n_a^2 / N^2$ mengira setiap shot sebagai sepakat dengan dirinya sendiri, yang menaikkan anggaran: secara purata ia memberikan $\\mathrm{IPR}_A + (1 - \\mathrm{IPR}_A)/N$ dan bukannya $\\mathrm{IPR}_A$. Memandangkan $\\mathrm{IPR}_A$ ialah kebarangkalian bahawa dua shot sepakat, kira hanya pasangan shot yang *berbeza*:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\widehat{\\mathrm{IPR}}_A = \\frac{\\sum_a n_a (n_a - 1)}{N (N - 1)}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\widehat{\\mathrm{IPR}}_A = \\frac{\\sum_a n_a (n_a - 1)}{N (N - 1)}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is unbiased, and it is what `ipr_from_shots` below computes.\n"
msgstr "Ini tidak berat sebelah, dan inilah yang dikira oleh `ipr_from_shots` di bawah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Estimator 2: Parseval expansion {#estimator-2-parseval-expansion}"
msgstr "Penganggar 2: pengembangan Parseval {#estimator-2-parseval-expansion}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IPR can also be written through the parities $\\langle Z_S \\rangle$ of all nonempty subsets $S$ of the marginal:\n"
msgstr "IPR juga boleh ditulis melalui pariti $\\langle Z_S \\rangle$ bagi semua subset tidak kosong $S$ bagi marginal:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Large\n"
"\\mathrm{IPR}_A = 2^{-n_A}\\Bigl(1 + \\sum_{\\emptyset \\neq S \\subseteq A} \\langle Z_S \\rangle^2\\Bigr)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Large\n"
"\\mathrm{IPR}_A = 2^{-n_A}\\Bigl(1 + \\sum_{\\emptyset \\neq S \\subseteq A} \\langle Z_S \\rangle^2\\Bigr)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This form matters because error mitigation methods such as PEA work on expectation values, not on probabilities.\n"
"**One qubit:** The outcome probabilities are $p(0) = (1 + \\langle Z \\rangle)/2$ and $p(1) = (1 - \\langle Z \\rangle)/2$, so\n"
msgstr ""
"Bentuk ini penting kerana kaedah mitigasi ralat seperti PEA bekerja pada nilai jangkaan, bukan pada kebarangkalian.\n"
"**Satu qubit:** Kebarangkalian hasil ialah $p(0) = (1 + \\langle Z \\rangle)/2$ dan $p(1) = (1 - \\langle Z \\rangle)/2$, jadi\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Large\n"
"\\mathrm{IPR} = p(0)^2 + p(1)^2 = \\frac{1 + \\langle Z \\rangle^2}{2}\n"
"$$\n"
"**A $2 \\times 2$ marginal:** With its qubits labeled $a, b, c, d$, the marginal has $2^4 - 1 = 15$ parities: 4 single qubits, 6 pairs, 4 triples, and the whole marginal, so\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Large\n"
"\\mathrm{IPR} = p(0)^2 + p(1)^2 = \\frac{1 + \\langle Z \\rangle^2}{2}\n"
"$$\n"
"**Marginal $2 \\times 2$:** Dengan qubitnya dilabelkan $a, b, c, d$, marginal mempunyai $2^4 - 1 = 15$ pariti: 4 qubit tunggal, 6 pasangan, 4 tripel, dan keseluruhan marginal, jadi\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Large\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{IPR} = \\frac{1}{16} \\Bigl(1\n"
"&+ \\langle Z_a \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_b \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_c \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_d \\rangle^2 \\\\\n"
"&+ \\langle Z_a Z_b \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_a Z_c \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_a Z_d \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_b Z_c \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_b Z_d \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_c Z_d \\rangle^2 \\\\\n"
"&+ \\langle Z_a Z_b Z_c \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_a Z_b Z_d \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_a Z_c Z_d \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_b Z_c Z_d \\rangle^2 \\\\\n"
"&+ \\langle Z_a Z_b Z_c Z_d \\rangle^2 \\Bigr)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Large\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{IPR} = \\frac{1}{16} \\Bigl(1\n"
"&+ \\langle Z_a \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_b \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_c \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_d \\rangle^2 \\\\\n"
"&+ \\langle Z_a Z_b \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_a Z_c \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_a Z_d \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_b Z_c \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_b Z_d \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_c Z_d \\rangle^2 \\\\\n"
"&+ \\langle Z_a Z_b Z_c \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_a Z_b Z_d \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_a Z_c Z_d \\rangle^2 + \\langle Z_b Z_c Z_d \\rangle^2 \\\\\n"
"&+ \\langle Z_a Z_b Z_c Z_d \\rangle^2 \\Bigr)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

